# Binary asset types. De-LFS'd in v0.1.1 so that plain source tarballs
# (git archive / GitHub auto-generated tarballs) carry the real bytes and
# external `zig fetch` consumers can @embedFile them. `binary` expands to
# `-text -diff`: no EOL conversion, no textual diff/merge.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.bmp binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.zig text eol=lf
